# Line endings are not a style question for these two: a shell script checked
# out with CRLF fails on Linux with "bash: \r: command not found", and a batch
# file with LF can misparse in cmd.exe. Pin both so the result does not depend
# on whatever core.autocrlf happens to be set to on the machine cloning.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.bat   text eol=crlf

# Everything else: normalise in the repo, let git pick on checkout.
*       text=auto

# Binaries git must not touch.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.apk   binary
*.jar   binary
*.so    binary
*.pyd   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
